  "invariants": [
    "The sponsor never holds custody of a complex asset at release 1; only cash proceeds from the intermediary are recorded as received (RCD-013, RCD-011).",
    "No grantable capacity before proceeds are Final.",
    "The §4943 combined-holdings test is recorded before referral and re-run on any related transaction (UNB-RCN-FIN-004).",
    "Exactly one of AcknowledgeAsDonee or RecordInboundCharitableTransfer applies, determined by the counsel-approved structure of the intermediary arrangement."
  ]
}
